flowchart LR
    Visitor[Visitor browser] --> UI[Blazor pages and shared components]
    Operator[Operator browser] --> UI
    Display[Public display] --> UI
    UI --> Auth[Cookie authentication and cascading state]
    UI --> Application[QueueService]
    Application --> Rules[Pure QueueRules]
    Application --> Gate[Write gate and transaction]
    Gate --> DB[(SQLite through EF Core)]
    Gate --> Audit[Audit entry in same transaction]
    Application --> Events[QueueChanges after commit]
    Events --> SignalR[Blazor SignalR circuits]
    SignalR --> UI
    Maintenance[30 second maintenance] --> Application
